{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48886","headline":"酬友人春暮寄枳花茶 · 李郢","name":"酬友人春暮寄枳花茶","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昨日东风吹枳花，酒醒春晚一瓯茶。\n如云正护幽人壍，似雪才分野老家。\n金饼拍成和雨露，玉尘煎出照烟霞。\n相如病渴今全校，不羡生台白颈鵶。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李郢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48886.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48886","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}